			<p>Started over 20 years ago Skip Hire Washington has developed a sturdy customer base throughout the household and small business market place. Purchasers come back to our company repeatedly. Skip Hire Washington is fully committed to recycling as much of the waste debris we collect as is possible. Currently we recycle up to 70 per cent of all the waste materials, however our final objective would be to get that number closer to 90-100%. We specialise in responsible waste management [...]</p>
